ng to note is that agatha's rabbit  is named senior scratchy now this could  very well just be an easter egg to her  son  nicholas scratch as i mentioned in the  beginning of the video or he could  actually be the one that she is trying  to summon and get into this realm  because in the comics once he's defeated  he gets banished to a different  dimension but he ends up coming back  now we didn't see billy or tommy in  agatha's lair  and they did show a pretty decent amount  of her lair  so they could be gone but i think that  marvel would like to show agatha trying  to summon a huge villain so  maybe they're still alive and maybe  there's a chance for wanda and vision to  save them  especially with the help of photon now  at the end of episode 7  agatha showed wanda what she's been  doing the entire time but i also think  that she took  wanda under her control and i think a  part of this is going to be  wiping her memory just like she does in  the comics she's going to wipe her  memory of the twins  i believe we'll see this in episode 8  but guess who has the power to  awaken people her good old husband  vision who is currently  on his way to go find wanda and once he  awakens her i think that's when we're in  for a very  very big battle at the end between  agatha harkness vision  wanda and photon i believe quicksilver  will be in there somewhere however i'm  not really sure if he  is indeed the actual quicksilver just  under her spell or if he's actually some  evil version  either way paul bettany said that  there's going to be a huge  final battle involving a lot of cgi  and action and this is what's going to  start happening in episode 8  and then in the finale and maybe even in  the post-credits scene we're going to  see agatha  actually summon this major villain and  that's when doctor strange is going to  get involved because she summoned an  ancient  mystical demon and that's how one  division is going to lead up to doctor  strange and the multiverse of madn